            <div xml:id="m-c4bce5db-9fc0-45d1-8619-811ed579859c">
              <lg xml:id="m-117c93f7-8723-4638-a6d3-7028eb7236c7">
                <l xml:id="m-fa8a36c1-01a0-43db-9271-ea36c36ccce8" facs="#m-43f8777e-df88-4147-b2cf-4d9083f98ba8" label="ambiguous">1052</l><l xml:id="m-215e083e-fbea-41a0-9c26-153bcf937a47" facs="#m-6144ec16-ad3d-4b9e-9032-aed83f9ea6e4" label="text-like">Saturday in Ember week of September.</l><l xml:id="m-47b519c3-fe3f-400f-a5c8-ebeead024f5f" facs="#m-e2d1ca30-4b57-4340-979f-e2a7b9d83f42" label="text-like">Saturday in Ember week of September.</l><l xml:id="m-1b43f588-1ba2-4008-b6eb-9501d70d0332" facs="#m-c440dd49-99e7-4276-abdb-91564cbc1640" label="text-like">AT MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-82ef82e5-2d57-49e9-9c50-4fcadc5cc3f0" facs="#m-cee69243-d698-44cf-8af7-0caf012d2f1d" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-cba16238-23cf-4a71-a985-f06bb27b8684" facs="#m-b3f05bef-b0c3-4369-aefe-a8234141c9cb" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-9422b2cb-66f0-4c2d-b54c-a51d816e842a" facs="#m-79b684d3-159d-4999-beaf-ceeb2d14f339" label="ambiguous">Y</l><l xml:id="m-84eafbce-25ce-4c08-8020-63287a3c9a58" facs="#m-270e7604-563e-4438-aa6e-36c4447a1bbb" label="lyrics-like">et pro-cidá¬</l><l xml:id="m-34659ad0-4ee2-4eba-8344-94053ab99a8d" facs="#m-c94b93c3-d93a-4562-888d-fd9600dd71d7" label="lyrics-like">Eni-te, "*ado-rémus Dé¬ um,</l><l xml:id="m-7c8fcfca-7e2f-4467-9ff3-4b8d3decb16d" facs="#m-7f33c741-9231-4484-b2a5-008a7b7895bd" label="lyrics-like">mus ante Dó-mi-num : plo-ré- mus ante é¬ um.</l><l xml:id="m-9502438d-8402-41b7-b717-9e51b8e11d4f" facs="#m-2bb6c023-e1e6-483d-a44b-27a0be9e5fba" label="lyrics-like">qui fé-cit nos: qui-a i- pse est Dómi- nus Dé¬ us</l><l xml:id="m-61f17ad8-7f81-498a-b774-0cdf3867d5e6" facs="#m-4860af4e-15af-4401-adc5-358db77b0c9b" label="lyrics-like">nó- ster. Ps. Veni-te, exsultémus Dómino: ju-bi-lémus</l><l xml:id="m-9cc44d52-f2f9-4844-99b3-b611433ed5c4" facs="#m-e1084c90-6d9a-44af-8dfc-845dba93bddf" label="lyrics-like">Dé-o sa-lu-tá-ri nóstro. Gló-ri- a Pátri. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-8f0a29fb-ca99-4944-9d23-d0474f2cfa6d" facs="#m-2b2c36a6-0c0d-4275-ad57-952b910654c2" label="lyrics-like">Kyrie eléison. as on Ferias in Advent and Lent, p. 62.</l><l xml:id="m-41ae2399-0a85-450b-8a4d-7bcc6f2b137f" facs="#m-9fa28301-e3d0-4b35-8ed6-6f91903c1c14" label="lyrics-like">The priest. Orémus. The Deacon. Flectámus génua. Sabdeacon. R. Le¬</l><l xml:id="m-7b65ffc7-77d4-40ee-a1ee-1b2c1b0b654e" facs="#m-56e6e631-fd20-4307-873f-e1ebc6cd4276" label="lyrics-like">váte.</l><l xml:id="m-82be3964-0fb4-44a1-9957-b9b773a85060" facs="#m-06a5c2a6-d569-4e66-8c8a-b5a1023655fc" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-cd37eedb-8c31-4cc5-859d-c3b45538f6b8" facs="#m-2347c12b-c698-4372-8f5f-eecd984a300b" label="lyrics-like">Mnípotens sempitérne Deus, qui lut pia jejunántium deprecatióne</l><l xml:id="m-cd42c709-f0f9-4a8b-814a-968031d9695e" facs="#m-cbc7b89c-193f-41ab-ba0c-a6b825e2c47d" label="lyrics-like">U per continéntiam salutárem cor-]placátus, et praeséntia nobis subsí¬</l><l xml:id="m-f9cc7dc3-091a-472f-9557-f21973132bb8" facs="#m-d92fe07a-1e4e-4313-b960-ed6397f48a59" label="lyrics-like">póribus medéris et méntibus: maje-[dia tribuas, et futúra. Per Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-bc6c9f47-cc23-4f66-a52c-b98b5ebc84a5" facs="#m-3f2fddba-3058-4bb2-a86f-0f596ade9917" label="lyrics-like">státem tuam súpplices exorámus;] num.</l><l xml:id="m-c15b5055-cc00-44ab-9b91-b1afbce19764" facs="#m-d230df0c-7d41-4d5d-80dd-542849f99859" label="ambiguous">Lesson I.</l><l xml:id="m-5048cd09-56da-4c81-be05-f1454215727b" facs="#m-85721a43-d446-446c-8eb5-3b12681efafe" label="lyrics-like">Léctio libri Levítici. Levit. 23. d.</l><l xml:id="m-5e1b940a-e81e-419a-9361-ba37475431f2" facs="#m-42802aeb-eab7-46a2-a734-bd24729150fb" label="lyrics-like">N diébus illis: Locútus est Dó-[lis suis: et quae óperis quidpiam</l><l xml:id="m-1f02fc7c-0d79-4a79-9652-4c3b41470b43" facs="#m-1b4edaa8-d122-43ac-b685-d5cf80d6c4b5" label="lyrics-like">L minus ad Móysen, dicens: Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-f4a7d49c-219e-4782-ad20-fd316bad193e" facs="#m-2e1b7420-623d-4d7c-ba64-915240b3aea5" label="lyrics-like">fécerit, delébo eam de pópulo suo.</l><l xml:id="m-544140c6-6e30-4b78-8034-ca25bde7ddca" facs="#m-0b018f3c-bf14-434b-9e6e-8dbb5ff4c5d4" label="lyrics-like">cimo die mensis hujus séptimi, dies</l><l xml:id="m-9f9c01fd-b86f-41cd-bc94-5a88ef598a7c" facs="#m-02f64d22-b36a-4b34-88d8-40aedbf58ef4" label="lyrics-like">Nihil ergo óperis faciétis in eo:</l><l xml:id="m-3a7b49e3-b3e1-4a3b-b1d8-7739f28f2737" facs="#m-c79865fa-7ae3-428d-a5c9-d79a3a9b4260" label="lyrics-like">expiatiónum erit celebérrimus, et</l><l xml:id="m-c2ca771c-dbc5-4d12-8393-2126ab584143" facs="#m-47b791a1-03ab-4e48-a857-80634af61f44" label="lyrics-like">legítimum sempitérnum erit vobis</l><l xml:id="m-8d97a3cc-bc90-46b4-af50-7e0f361fe9e5" facs="#m-36b3c3fb-d2e3-4053-b42a-8d253d4765e8" label="lyrics-like">vocábitur sanctus: affligetisque</l><l xml:id="m-42ac8375-0f5b-433a-8926-6a8f4dacf129" facs="#m-9eda3e85-fe0d-49ac-bec8-81c6f904b0d4" label="lyrics-like">in cunctis generatiónibus, et habi¬</l><l xml:id="m-cdd9cff0-0cdc-4112-bf62-e70d2485f216" facs="#m-42f85e7b-32ef-4281-83ee-747686618bd2" label="lyrics-like">tatiónibus vestris. Sábbatum requie¬</l><l xml:id="m-578d6b52-1361-4456-8d9b-8c833f389ae2" facs="#m-db74059f-7ed7-4eb0-a7d4-5a207b0582bf" label="lyrics-like">ánimas vestras in eo, et offerétis</l><l xml:id="m-76c65fb9-6a7a-493e-b672-b5ff0932c719" facs="#m-5582bcba-0d8e-4666-ace3-6f21beb02be4" label="lyrics-like">holocáustum Dómino. Omne opus</l><l xml:id="m-412a90a3-e537-4e14-a428-f9a76489957c" facs="#m-65eb7825-58a3-48db-be79-9a38b721790a" label="lyrics-like">tiónis est, et affligétis ánimas ve¬</l><l xml:id="m-28ba608d-c7d6-461a-9336-86d7e150ec48" facs="#m-a7f9976a-1679-4ca2-be6d-2851a37b5e8e" label="lyrics-like">servile non faciétis in témpore diéi</l><l xml:id="m-7028cb16-d77f-4923-a84a-7f0f7ea34410" facs="#m-874f498a-ae1d-44c9-bbbe-bf6398c58160" label="lyrics-like">stras die nono mensis: a véspera</l><l xml:id="m-8985d837-25d6-42b7-9a77-2b9e1c80a7c1" facs="#m-43cd2f19-08eb-4b55-aebe-a00ae755a178" label="lyrics-like">hujus: quia dies propitiatiónis est,</l><l xml:id="m-d62b2ddd-feab-4baf-9c12-856b4cf022ca" facs="#m-22922df2-b015-4992-9161-ca3bde8e2dc2" label="lyrics-like">usque ad vésperam celebrábitis sáb¬</l><l xml:id="m-6bdb68e5-52c1-4799-9d38-18bdd112b98f" facs="#m-e5787519-a98d-43a7-9676-537a0c04e11b" label="lyrics-like">ut propitiétur vobis Dóminus Deus</l><l xml:id="m-5f0d18e3-974a-4fff-8643-b6eb3404f42a" facs="#m-378813df-3ae4-4b22-9208-8331f8ca1fa1" label="lyrics-like">bata vestra: dicit Dóminus omní¬</l><l xml:id="m-f779ecf4-7ae7-4edd-8d07-3940d71fd178" facs="#m-92f9a0c1-f193-4621-8ef5-5ce18e01a3ee" label="lyrics-like">vester. Omnis ánima, quae afflicta</l><l xml:id="m-30970d2f-dd18-4a7a-9ce0-54c28a5ee0f6" facs="#m-07fa76cd-34c3-4cb6-8628-54ac73001e80" label="ambiguous">potens.</l><l xml:id="m-9e88cf01-8ca4-44c0-b43a-6f5f791fced3" facs="#m-84b16ecb-6292-43d6-bf93-d3d7b69449bd" label="lyrics-like">non fuerit die bac, peribit de pópu¬</l><l xml:id="m-781d5b4f-e0cd-4f60-b4b1-75587d74230c" facs="#m-9e280f23-f942-4378-8ef3-3f92addc8a6f" label="lyrics-like">Gradual. Propitius ésto. p. 999.</l></lg>
            </div>
